        </button>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative bg-stone-100 min-h-[420px] flex items-end justify-center pb-10 px-6 text-center bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515886657613-9f3515b0c78f?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1000');">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/25"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10 text-white max-w-md space-y-3">
            <span class="text-xs tracking-widest opacity-90">الموسم الجديد 2026</span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-light leading-snug">ثقة هادئة، وأناقة تُرتدى.</h2>
            <p class="text-xs opacity-80 font-light">قصّات مدروسة وطبقات سهلة، صُممت لترافق كل لحظة من يومك.</p>
            <button class="mt-3 px-6 py-2.5 bg-white text-stone-900 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-stone-100 transition shadow-sm rounded-sm">تسَوّقي الجديد</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Content Area -->
    <main class="max-w-md mx-auto px-4 py-8 w-full space-y-6">
        
